Z||000000||BBBAD GT||12-14-2000||05:25 PM||||Just wanted to pass this along, I was driving to work today and the steering wheel was all over the place on the highway.  Couldn't figure it out.<P>Pulled over, and looked at the wheels, and they still had some ice stuck on them from the winter storm we had, kicked off the large chunks, and it went away.  <P>Started to think this made sense, because I'm sure the balance of the wheels were completely out with the large chunks of ice stuck to the front wheels.  <P>Stupid ice......<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/BBBAD_GT_SIG.gif">    <P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/V8Fiero" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD V8</A><P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/Fiero.htm" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD GT</A><P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD 5.0</A>||||reg||1
